<title>USA: Crane Co Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Crane Co Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands)</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	    1996</p>
<p> Net Income					 22,645	 18,208</p>
<p> Net Income Per Share				.49	    .40</p>
<p> Average Primary Shares			 46,337	 45,780</p>
<p> Revenues					  467,333	436,463</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said, in mid-March, it acquired Sequentia Inc, a privately-held reinforced fiberglass company.</p>
<p>The company also said it acquired Polyvend Inc in March, a privately-held snack and food vending machine manufacturer.</p>
</text>
